  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Tech sphere, Ammo Spitter, Alchemy sphere (formulae) package.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your ammo spitter may create alchemical or complex ammunition (such as alchemical cartridges and vial bolts) costing 50 gp or less. This alchemical ammunition doesn’t have to be made exclusively for firearms but the weapon firing it must still meet all the prerequisites (such as having the scatter quality).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc122\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
